id: hated
name: Hated
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 4
# Not a Combat Condition: Hate Empowerment (2)'s - a stack for every 2 Revenge Points spent, each on a clock of its own till
# the start of your next turn.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Hate Empowerment: Soak Value 1(T) higher for each stack, till the start of your next turn - 4(T) at most.
text: >
  Hate Empowerment (2): Each time you spend Revenge Points, for every 2 Revenge Points spent, increase your Soak Value by 1(T) until the start of your next turn. The bonus to your Soak Value from this effect cannot exceed 4(T).

---

[passive]
soakValue += stacks * 1(T);
